# ── Video production working files (report/video/_video_live) ──
# Only the FINAL deliverable (../Documentation_DEMO_VIDEO.mp4) and the build
# tooling (tts.ps1, DEMO_VIDEO_SCRIPT.md) are tracked. Everything below is
# regenerable intermediates: raw Playwright captures, per-segment encodes,
# narration WAVs, and the concat manifest with absolute paths.
